        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Shawl, fine dark blue cotton with deep borders and hems of gold-wrapped thread and coloured silk brocade, the end panels contain rows of flowering trees in pots, interspersed with bunches of flowers, and bands of flowers at the top and bottom and more bands of flowers in the added borders. With fringes. Complete piece."@en , "Intended for use as a garment, clothing."@en , "Textile, shawl, woven cotton, silk and gold-wrapped thread, Dhaulpur, ca. 1850"@en ;
